              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ordinary+cohomology"} ordinary cohomology
              of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-sphere"} n-sphere
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fiber"} fiber
              is concentrated in just two degees
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi H
                      %mi t
