                    H^{n+1}(B; R)
            %p for the image of this element under the differential. We will show that this is the Euler class in question.
            %p
              To that end, notice that every element in
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
